                                "sense_id": "45a8305a-c64a-3f4d-be68-e167b628b0b3",
                                "text": "[…] the first fact that craves our attention is that the Alfar, (Elves, Awfs,) and Dvergar, (Dwarfs,) stand in contrast with each other"
                            },
